#X text 176 370 Change Waveform;
#X text 230 436 The waveform of the chord can be changed here. This is useful for compositional purposes. The 'change-chord-wave' send could have gone directly to the waveform-selector patches \, but this makes it easy to see what's happening \, and can be changed manually., f 33;
